From: Onuralp SEZER <thunderbirdtr@fedoraproject.org>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:55:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "ASoC: sdw_utils: Switch CS35L56/57/62/63 to use OT25
 DAI"

This reverts stable commit bf7a3ce1d563 (upstream 4b7f393a01f8) in 7.2.11.

It switches the amp feedback of CS35L56/57/62/63 to the "cs35l56-ot25" DAI,
but that DAI is added to the codec driver by the previous patch of the same
series, upstream 86c8360c97f6 ("ASoC: cs35l56: Add DAI for SDCA OT25
stream"), which 7.2.11 does not have. sof_sdw then fails with

  sof_sdw sof_sdw: ASoC: CODEC DAI cs35l56-ot25 not registered

and no sound card registers at all on the Dell XPS 16 DA16260 (four
CS35L57 amps on SoundWire links 2 and 3, CS42L45 on link 0): no speakers,
headphones or microphones. Going back to the cs35l56-sdw1c DAI restores the
7.2.10 behaviour. Drop this once the stable tree carries 86c8360c97f6.

Signed-off-by: Onuralp SEZER <thunderbirdtr@fedoraproject.org>
---
 sound/soc/sdw_utils/soc_sdw_utils.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/sdw_utils/soc_sdw_utils.c b/sound/soc/sdw_utils/soc_sdw_utils.c
--- a/sound/soc/sdw_utils/soc_sdw_utils.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sdw_utils/soc_sdw_utils.c
@@ -797,7 +797,7 @@
 			},
 			{
 				.direction = {false, true},
-				.dai_name = "cs35l56-ot25",
+				.dai_name = "cs35l56-sdw1c",
 				.dai_type = SOC_SDW_DAI_TYPE_AMP,
 				.dailink = {SOC_SDW_UNUSED_DAI_ID, SOC_SDW_AMP_IN_DAI_ID},
 				.rtd_init = asoc_sdw_cs_spk_feedback_rtd_init,
@@ -826,7 +826,7 @@
 			},
 			{
 				.direction = {false, true},
-				.dai_name = "cs35l56-ot25",
+				.dai_name = "cs35l56-sdw1c",
 				.dai_type = SOC_SDW_DAI_TYPE_AMP,
 				.dailink = {SOC_SDW_UNUSED_DAI_ID, SOC_SDW_AMP_IN_DAI_ID},
 				.rtd_init = asoc_sdw_cs_spk_feedback_rtd_init,
@@ -855,7 +855,7 @@
 			},
 			{
 				.direction = {false, true},
-				.dai_name = "cs35l56-ot25",
+				.dai_name = "cs35l56-sdw1c",
 				.dai_type = SOC_SDW_DAI_TYPE_AMP,
 				.dailink = {SOC_SDW_UNUSED_DAI_ID, SOC_SDW_AMP_IN_DAI_ID},
 				.rtd_init = asoc_sdw_cs_spk_feedback_rtd_init,
@@ -884,7 +884,7 @@
 			},
 			{
 				.direction = {false, true},
-				.dai_name = "cs35l56-ot25",
+				.dai_name = "cs35l56-sdw1c",
 				.dai_type = SOC_SDW_DAI_TYPE_AMP,
 				.dailink = {SOC_SDW_UNUSED_DAI_ID, SOC_SDW_AMP_IN_DAI_ID},
 				.rtd_init = asoc_sdw_cs_spk_feedback_rtd_init,
